WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:37.350
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:37.620 --> 01:42.990
[Spring of The Blade]

3
01:43.350 --> 01:45.960
[Episode 18]

4
01:48.000 --> 01:48.750
Qingyuan!

5
01:50.430 --> 01:52.090
Don't ruin your entire family

6
01:52.470 --> 01:53.840
just for your mother!

7
01:55.030 --> 01:56.200
This has...

8
01:58.789 --> 01:59.990
never been my family.

9
02:03.150 --> 02:04.070
Qingyuan!

10
02:12.230 --> 02:13.640
[Harmony Among Kin]

11
02:13.800 --> 02:14.590
Since Zhenglun

12
02:14.000 --> 02:19.180
[A Legacy of Virtue for Eternity]

13
02:14.800 --> 02:16.460
was registered under my name,

14
02:16.800 --> 02:19.530
he's the legitimate eldest son of the Xie family.

15
02:19.680 --> 02:20.630
He deserves

16
02:21.000 --> 02:22.329
a respectable funeral.

17
02:22.870 --> 02:25.710
I've invited the Taoist priest from Qingyang Temple

18
02:25.710 --> 02:27.840
to conduct rites for 7 days.

19
02:28.560 --> 02:30.220
Please rest assured, Mother.

20
02:32.750 --> 02:33.630
Wenzhuo.

21
02:33.800 --> 02:34.530
Yes, Mother.

22
02:35.240 --> 02:36.520
See to it that

23
02:37.470 --> 02:39.400
Yinghua's properly taken care of.

24
02:39.710 --> 02:41.030
When the funeral takes place,

25
02:41.030 --> 02:44.030
it's only natural and right for the biological mother

26
02:45.120 --> 02:47.240
to see her son off one last time.

27
02:48.470 --> 02:49.280
Mother,

28
02:50.710 --> 02:51.910
the physician said

29
02:52.960 --> 02:55.690
psychosis is most easily triggered by funerals.

30
02:56.030 --> 02:58.430
If she makes a scene in the mourning hall,

31
02:59.430 --> 03:01.160
it'll be a nightmare to handle.

32
03:05.030 --> 03:08.910
You're truly born stupid.

33
03:18.160 --> 03:19.850
[Xie Clan Ancestral Hall]

34
03:20.360 --> 03:21.870
A son of the Xie family

35
03:22.070 --> 03:23.520
fell on the battlefield,

36
03:24.520 --> 03:26.520
bringing supreme glory to our name.

37
03:27.150 --> 03:29.710
If outsiders find out that you, the Head Madam,

38
03:29.710 --> 03:32.040
prevented his birth mother, a concubine,

39
03:33.240 --> 03:34.430
from attending

40
03:34.430 --> 03:37.590
the funeral of her son who died with military distinction,

41
03:37.590 --> 03:40.710
it's not just you who will be disgraced.

42
03:41.590 --> 03:42.680
If you're worried,

43
03:43.800 --> 03:45.680
assign four matrons to watch her.

44
03:46.360 --> 03:49.240
When the time comes, she can pay her respects

45
03:50.190 --> 03:51.590
in the side hall.

46
03:53.710 --> 03:54.310
Yes.

47
03:54.990 --> 03:59.329
[A Legacy of Virtue for Eternity]

48
04:03.840 --> 04:06.840
For now, other than Zhenglun's funeral,

49
04:08.150 --> 04:09.410
leave everything else

50
04:09.960 --> 04:11.470
in this house alone.

51
04:19.570 --> 04:22.790
[Harmony Among Kin]

52
04:26.950 --> 04:28.510
It's been 20 years.

53
04:33.750 --> 04:36.150
I poured my heart and soul into this family.

54
04:37.000 --> 04:39.460
But even with Mei Yinghua out of the picture,

55
04:41.190 --> 04:42.850
she still treats me like this.

56
04:43.220 --> 04:46.580
[A Legacy of Virtue for Eternity]

57
04:44.510 --> 04:45.240
Madam,

58
04:45.270 --> 04:46.390
don't worry.

59
04:47.190 --> 04:49.150
At best, the Old Madam is weaponizing

60
04:49.150 --> 04:52.280
her seniority and demands for filial piety against you.

61
04:53.070 --> 04:55.150
We're not without a backer.

62
04:56.070 --> 04:57.330
You have your brother.

63
04:57.920 --> 04:59.050
Why be afraid of her?

64
05:04.310 --> 05:05.800
I can only rely on him now.

65
05:07.260 --> 05:10.200
[Cultivate Personal Virtue and Integrity]

66
05:20.480 --> 05:21.000
My Lady,

67
05:21.240 --> 05:23.010
I've bought the dried persimmons you asked for.

68
05:23.010 --> 05:25.160
A portion's been sent to the mourning hall for Eldest Young Master.

69
05:25.160 --> 05:27.090
I brought the other portion to you.

70
05:28.920 --> 05:29.520
By the way,

71
05:29.750 --> 05:31.630
here's a letter from Lord Yan.

72
05:33.790 --> 05:36.690
[Respectfully to Fourth Lady Qingyuan]

73
05:39.680 --> 05:40.870
Did Lord Yan

74
05:41.070 --> 05:42.630
apologize to you?

75
05:45.650 --> 05:46.830
There was no argument to begin with.

76
05:46.830 --> 05:47.960
Why'd he apologize?

77
05:49.630 --> 05:51.630
He's asking me to go see Granny Chen.

78
05:52.240 --> 05:54.700
I bet he wants her to put in a good word for him.

79
05:54.830 --> 05:56.390
He's just counting on the fact

80
05:56.390 --> 05:58.510
that you can't be angry with him in front of Granny.

81
05:56.909 --> 05:58.550
[Sincerely, Yan Rui]

82
06:00.920 --> 06:01.430
What's wrong?

83
06:01.430 --> 06:02.690
Did something happen?

84
06:03.680 --> 06:04.480
Granny is ill.

85
06:10.800 --> 06:12.310
Lord Yan found out you were sick

86
06:12.310 --> 06:13.630
before I did.

87
06:14.070 --> 06:15.930
He's here too, to take care of you.

88
06:17.430 --> 06:18.000
Here.

89
06:18.870 --> 06:19.470
Thank you.

90
06:22.480 --> 06:23.040
Granny,

91
06:24.310 --> 06:26.040
I've been a bad granddaughter.

92
06:26.830 --> 06:28.430
Don't say that.

93
06:29.630 --> 06:32.190
I just caught a mild cold,

94
06:32.560 --> 06:34.490
and I'm almost all better already.

95
06:35.270 --> 06:36.870
I'm thrilled that

96
06:37.600 --> 06:39.000
you and Yan are here.

97
06:39.680 --> 06:40.830
But my baby,

98
06:41.390 --> 06:43.950
running out so late at night,

99
06:43.950 --> 06:45.210
are you sure it's okay?

100
06:45.310 --> 06:46.070
It's fine.

101
06:46.720 --> 06:48.680
The entire Xie family is in a mess

102
06:48.950 --> 06:50.310
and busy with the funeral.

103
06:50.310 --> 06:51.710
No one has time to mind me.

104
06:55.800 --> 06:57.150
I heard about that too.

105
06:58.510 --> 07:00.800
They all say Eldest Young Master Xie

106
07:01.360 --> 07:03.040
was an upright man.

107
07:05.430 --> 07:06.360
What a pity.

108
07:09.920 --> 07:10.720
Dear,

109
07:11.750 --> 07:13.870
don't be too sad.

110
07:14.510 --> 07:15.950
Eldest Young Master Xie

111
07:16.430 --> 07:18.360
led a noble and virtuous life.

112
07:18.720 --> 07:20.680
He's destined for a blessed next life.

113
07:20.680 --> 07:24.070
He'll be born into a wealthy and kind family.

114
07:30.270 --> 07:32.130
I'll go boil the medicine for you.

115
07:32.360 --> 07:34.430
Then I'll recover even faster.

116
07:39.070 --> 07:39.830
Yan.

117
07:41.720 --> 07:42.320
Come here.

118
07:43.750 --> 07:44.360
Come here!

119
07:46.560 --> 07:47.240
Granny.

120
07:49.070 --> 07:49.830
Yan,

121
07:50.510 --> 07:51.950
Yunya has always

122
07:52.270 --> 07:54.120
kept things to herself since she was little.

123
07:54.120 --> 07:55.190
It seems

124
07:55.630 --> 07:58.150
Eldest Young Master Xie's death has been

125
07:58.510 --> 07:59.770
quite a big blow to her.

126
08:00.120 --> 08:01.720
Please help me comfort her.

127
08:06.360 --> 08:07.160
Rest assured.

128
08:17.400 --> 08:19.390
These are freshly dried persimmons from Northern Frontier.

129
08:19.390 --> 08:20.720
They're soft and sweet.

130
08:21.120 --> 08:22.250
I picked three kinds

131
08:22.480 --> 08:24.410
and chose the sweetest one for you.

132
08:24.510 --> 08:25.170
Take a look.

133
08:26.160 --> 08:27.190
If you like them,

134
08:27.630 --> 08:29.430
I'll dry a whole rack when I get back

135
08:29.430 --> 08:30.960
just for us siblings to eat.

136
08:59.360 --> 09:00.240
Are you okay?

137
09:06.000 --> 09:06.630
I'm fine.

138
09:10.120 --> 09:12.650
Even Granny Chen could tell you're troubled.

139
09:13.120 --> 09:14.650
She asked me to comfort you.

140
09:19.910 --> 09:21.170
When my eldest brother

141
09:21.200 --> 09:22.360
came back this time,

142
09:23.510 --> 09:26.640
he brought me some Northern Frontier dried persimmons.

143
09:26.870 --> 09:28.130
I liked them very much.

144
09:29.120 --> 09:31.120
He said he'd bring me more next time.

145
09:32.000 --> 09:33.660
But there won't be a next time.

146
09:35.790 --> 09:37.390
Sometimes I wonder:

147
09:39.670 --> 09:40.630
if I hadn't

148
09:41.840 --> 09:43.510
come to the Xie Residence,

149
09:45.200 --> 09:46.720
would he still be alive?

150
09:53.480 --> 09:54.360
Yan Rui,

151
09:56.510 --> 09:57.790
why are human lives

152
09:58.720 --> 10:00.240
so short?

153
10:01.960 --> 10:03.360
So short that there's...

154
10:05.910 --> 10:07.840
not even time for a proper goodbye.

155
10:17.360 --> 10:18.440
Xie Qingyuan,

156
10:18.910 --> 10:20.040
it's not your fault.

157
10:20.960 --> 10:22.290
That was a battlefield,

158
10:22.360 --> 10:25.150
where thousands of lives are sacrificed for one general's victory.

159
10:25.150 --> 10:26.360
As a general,

160
10:27.480 --> 10:29.810
Zhenglun must've been prepared for this.

161
10:33.550 --> 10:35.390
Many soldiers perish in battle.

162
10:36.600 --> 10:38.060
Zhenglun isn't the first,

163
10:38.550 --> 10:39.960
and he won't be the last.

164
10:46.790 --> 10:49.000
I've seen arrows fall like rainstorms

165
10:51.150 --> 10:53.550
and wounded comrades crawling in the mud.

166
10:54.870 --> 10:56.800
The blood soaked in melted snow...

167
10:59.150 --> 11:00.480
is as hot as this stove.

168
11:15.150 --> 11:17.410
I've actually been wanting to ask you...

169
11:21.630 --> 11:22.510
Are you...

170
11:26.120 --> 11:27.250
-Actually, I… -Yan.

171
11:28.440 --> 11:29.300
It's time to go.

172
11:29.750 --> 11:30.510
It's 7:45 PM.

173
11:36.510 --> 11:37.440
You're leaving?

174
11:42.750 --> 11:44.680
Hengtang is full of watchful eyes.

175
11:44.720 --> 11:45.600
If we don't leave now,

176
11:45.600 --> 11:47.530
who knows what trouble might come.

177
11:56.550 --> 11:57.880
Wait for me to come back.

178
12:01.630 --> 12:02.560
When I come back,

179
12:02.910 --> 12:04.510
whatever you want to know...

180
12:07.320 --> 12:08.200
I will tell you.

181
12:38.390 --> 12:39.630
I told you

182
12:39.910 --> 12:41.840
she'd only hold you back.

183
12:40.000 --> 12:41.970
[Chen]

184
12:42.840 --> 12:43.750
So,

185
12:43.960 --> 12:45.960
you came to find me an hour early?

186
12:47.750 --> 12:49.410
I'm cutting the Gordian knot.

187
12:49.960 --> 12:51.560
You were reluctant to leave,

188
12:51.670 --> 12:53.080
so I had to give you a push.

189
13:00.600 --> 13:02.200
Let Granny have a look at you.

190
13:06.670 --> 13:07.870
You've lost weight.

191
13:09.200 --> 13:10.840
Blame the chefs at Xie Residence.

192
13:10.840 --> 13:12.900
Their cooking isn't as good as yours.

193
13:13.790 --> 13:16.840
When did you learn to be a smooth talker?

194
13:17.550 --> 13:18.270
Sit here.

195
13:18.870 --> 13:20.720
I'll make you 2 sugar pancakes,

196
13:20.910 --> 13:22.720
your favorite when you were a kid.

197
13:22.720 --> 13:23.320
Granny,

198
13:23.670 --> 13:25.930
you just took your medicine. Go to sleep.

199
13:26.320 --> 13:26.960
I'm okay.

200
13:26.960 --> 13:27.960
Feel my forehead.

201
13:27.960 --> 13:30.550
After taking your medicine, my fever is gone.

202
13:32.320 --> 13:33.450
You don't want food,

203
13:33.630 --> 13:35.670
but I do! How else am I

204
13:35.670 --> 13:36.630
to fall asleep?

205
13:38.750 --> 13:39.960
Eat some with me.

206
13:41.960 --> 13:42.510
Okay.

207
13:42.630 --> 13:43.360
I'll make it.

208
13:44.240 --> 13:46.440
Will it taste the same if you make it?

209
13:46.960 --> 13:47.960
Sit here and wait.

210
13:50.670 --> 13:53.000
Yan is such a good kid.

211
14:16.910 --> 14:17.840
When I come back,

212
14:18.200 --> 14:19.660
whatever you want to know,

213
14:20.750 --> 14:21.610
I will tell you.

214
14:27.550 --> 14:28.510
Granny?

215
14:30.480 --> 14:31.200
Granny.

216
14:35.320 --> 14:36.550
Lady Xie.

217
14:42.840 --> 14:44.500
Lord Wei, what brings you here

218
14:45.000 --> 14:46.000
at this late hour?

219
14:46.550 --> 14:49.440
I came to ask you for a cup of tea, of course.

220
14:51.720 --> 14:53.360
Sorry to trouble you.

221
14:54.600 --> 14:56.440
I only have low-grade tea,

222
14:57.030 --> 14:59.030
which might not suit your taste.

223
15:00.320 --> 15:01.030
Therefore,

224
15:01.910 --> 15:03.790
I must trouble you

225
15:03.790 --> 15:05.200
to come with me.

226
15:08.230 --> 15:09.850
Yunya, run!

227
15:10.600 --> 15:11.320
Granny!

228
15:14.150 --> 15:14.870
Let her go!

229
15:15.960 --> 15:16.890
I'll go with you.

230
15:47.670 --> 15:48.440
My Lord!

231
15:49.960 --> 15:51.020
Stop the carriage.

232
15:51.790 --> 15:52.550
My Lord!

233
15:53.480 --> 15:54.910
Fourth Lady's been abducted.

234
15:54.910 --> 15:56.320
I was also told to relay a message:

235
15:56.320 --> 15:57.360
go to the old Shen residence

236
15:57.360 --> 15:58.320
alone,

237
15:58.550 --> 15:59.550
or she dies!

238
16:03.840 --> 16:04.790
If you go,

239
16:05.030 --> 16:06.510
we're no longer brothers.

240
16:22.910 --> 16:23.790
Lord Wei,

241
16:24.440 --> 16:26.410
if you're trying to use me as bait

242
16:26.510 --> 16:28.000
to lure Lord Yan out,

243
16:28.440 --> 16:30.440
I'm afraid you'll be disappointed.

244
16:31.030 --> 16:32.830
I'm just a plaything for Lord Yan

245
16:33.030 --> 16:34.320
in Hengtang

246
16:34.670 --> 16:35.510
to kill time

247
16:35.510 --> 16:37.550
when he is bored.

248
16:38.200 --> 16:39.530
If you don't believe me,

249
16:40.390 --> 16:42.390
you can lock me up for a night and see.

250
16:43.120 --> 16:44.670
Ouch, My Lady,

251
16:44.870 --> 16:47.070
your words are like daggers to my heart.

252
16:50.790 --> 16:52.550
Lord Yan, how gutsy of you

253
16:53.030 --> 16:54.870
to come alone.

254
16:55.200 --> 16:56.510
Impressive.

255
16:57.840 --> 16:58.870
Lord Wei,

256
16:59.320 --> 17:01.520
you went to such lengths to lure me here,

257
17:01.600 --> 17:03.080
but have you ever considered

258
17:03.080 --> 17:04.160
that if you kill me,

259
17:04.510 --> 17:05.770
you won't live either?

260
17:08.349 --> 17:09.550
Then let's find out.

261
17:21.720 --> 17:23.349
Even if I can't defeat you,

262
17:25.000 --> 17:27.460
someone will accompany me to the afterlife.

263
17:36.790 --> 17:37.830
Lord Yan,

264
17:38.270 --> 17:39.330
doesn't this place

265
17:40.640 --> 17:42.160
feel familiar to you?

266
17:58.480 --> 17:59.160
My Lord,

267
17:59.440 --> 18:01.110
guilty of bribery and corruption,

268
18:01.110 --> 18:02.680
Shen Zhibai's estate has been seized,

269
18:02.680 --> 18:04.160
and 73 people in his residence

270
18:04.160 --> 18:05.790
have been executed on the spot.

271
18:05.790 --> 18:06.480
But...

272
18:06.590 --> 18:07.270
What is it?

273
18:08.100 --> 18:09.310
His eldest son, Shen Run,

274
18:09.310 --> 18:10.370
wasn't among them.

275
18:10.550 --> 18:12.880
Someone saw him in a house in the south of the city.

276
18:12.880 --> 18:14.410
Leave no survivors.

277
18:15.000 --> 18:15.880
Go find him now!

278
18:16.200 --> 18:16.720
Yes!

279
18:22.070 --> 18:23.640
That night, 9 years ago,

280
18:24.680 --> 18:27.310
the whole family here was killed overnight,

281
18:28.550 --> 18:30.550
and only two kids managed to escape.

282
18:37.350 --> 18:40.350
Before, I couldn't figure out

283
18:40.920 --> 18:42.160
why you,

284
18:42.680 --> 18:46.270
Lord Yan, targeted me at every turn.

285
18:48.750 --> 18:50.480
But the night of the grain distribution,

286
18:50.480 --> 18:51.740
I finally understood.

287
18:52.750 --> 18:54.240
The enemy is right in front of you,

288
18:54.240 --> 18:55.880
yet you still think about that woman.

289
18:55.880 --> 18:57.810
Do you really think you're Yan Rui?

290
19:01.000 --> 19:05.480
You're one of the two bastards who escaped from the Shen residence—

291
19:06.030 --> 19:07.270
Shen Run.

292
19:27.790 --> 19:28.550
Kill him.

293
20:14.750 --> 20:15.350
Freeze!

294
20:39.440 --> 20:40.440
Wei Changyan,

295
20:41.310 --> 20:42.640
I can give you a way out.

296
20:43.350 --> 20:44.410
Let her go, and I'll

297
20:45.030 --> 20:47.160
personally escort you out of the city.

298
20:49.310 --> 20:51.790
Such great kindness, Lord Yan.

299
20:52.270 --> 20:54.830
You're making me emotional.

300
20:55.400 --> 20:56.440
However,

301
20:57.070 --> 20:59.000
you must also show some sincerity.

302
21:00.000 --> 21:00.930
Forget about me.

303
21:03.550 --> 21:04.510
If I die,

304
21:04.510 --> 21:05.550
kill him for me.

305
21:07.720 --> 21:09.240
What a woman of steel.

306
21:10.680 --> 21:11.550
Lord Yan,

307
21:12.110 --> 21:13.570
if you don't want her dead,

308
21:14.270 --> 21:15.440
put down the sword.

309
21:33.270 --> 21:33.850
Kill him!

310
21:45.540 --> 21:49.870
♪ I counted every moment ♪

311
21:49.940 --> 21:54.030
♪ Memories take root; the annual rings grow ♪

312
21:54.050 --> 21:58.570
♪ Who bore the parting wind ♪

313
21:58.600 --> 22:03.330
♪ And wove it gently into the warmth of the past? ♪

314
22:03.310 --> 22:04.720
Have you ever loved a woman?

315
22:03.360 --> 22:07.530
♪ I honor every scar upon your hand ♪

316
22:07.110 --> 22:08.400
I just want to know

317
22:07.550 --> 22:11.940
♪ Through endless nights, a lone soul wanders this mortal world ♪

318
22:09.440 --> 22:10.900
under what circumstances

319
22:11.110 --> 22:12.750
a man would

320
22:11.960 --> 22:18.620
♪ Turning back, we embrace— one fleeting moment of love and hate ♪

321
22:14.000 --> 22:15.790
give up the woman he loves.

322
22:18.690 --> 22:21.620
♪ As flowers fall beneath the dusk ♪

323
22:20.270 --> 22:21.440
Don't be anxious.

324
22:21.830 --> 22:25.030
I'll send you two star-crossed lovers to the afterlife

325
22:25.550 --> 22:27.000
together right now.

326
22:30.200 --> 22:31.310
To protect her.

327
22:57.880 --> 22:58.350
Yan...

328
23:45.200 --> 23:46.270
All we can do is

329
23:47.270 --> 23:49.200
remember the faces of our enemies.

330
23:49.590 --> 23:50.510
When we grow up,

331
23:51.310 --> 23:52.770
no matter where they hide,

332
23:53.240 --> 23:55.240
no matter how many of them there are,

333
