496
32:31.750 --> 32:32.680
Long time no see.

497
32:37.070 --> 32:38.310
Long time no see.

498
32:39.770 --> 32:40.750
Chunzhi.

499
32:40.920 --> 32:42.030
Qingru's been

500
32:42.310 --> 32:44.440
