508
32:59.880 --> 33:01.410
I'll go prepare some fruit.

509
33:01.720 --> 33:02.780
Thank you, Mother.

510
33:02.880 --> 33:03.480
Good girl.

511
33:05.070 --> 33:06.200
Take care, Madam Hu.

512
33:07.240 --> 33:09.500
Marriages in a small place like Hengtang

513
33:09.640 --> 33:11.170
have always been like this.

514
33:11.480 --> 33:13.400
They look for families of equal status

515
33:13.400 --> 33:15.720
and choose those with similar backgrounds.

516
33:15.720 --> 33:16.510
In the end,

517
33:17.070 --> 33:19.270
it's just picking from the leftovers of these

518
33:19.270 --> 33:20.530
four or five families.

519
33:20.680 --> 33:22.940
Even if both families detest each other,

520
33:23.200 --> 33:24.240
well aware that

521
33:24.590 --> 33:26.740
the other is far from virtuous,

522
33:27.000 --> 33:29.590
they still go through with the marriage alliance.

523
33:29.590 --> 33:33.270
All they want is for their descendants

524
33:33.720 --> 33:35.640
to be deeply rooted

525
33:36.110 --> 33:37.350
in Hengtang,

526
33:37.830 --> 33:39.070
so as to

527
33:39.440 --> 33:43.030
safeguard their place at this table of future wealth.

528
33:44.070 --> 33:45.000
These words of yours

529
33:45.000 --> 33:46.350
are truly

530
33:46.680 --> 33:47.830
enlightening.

531
33:48.590 --> 33:49.750
For this marriage between

532
33:49.750 --> 33:51.610
the Xie family and the marquis's,

533
33:51.750 --> 33:53.610
no matter who is chosen in the end,

534
33:53.640 --> 33:54.960
