540
34:09.920 --> 34:10.880
I understand.

541
34:11.510 --> 34:13.880
Young Master Li thinks he is engaged to me,

542
34:14.360 --> 34:17.230
when you and my mother have actually chosen

543
34:17.230 --> 34:18.230
