546
34:28.960 --> 34:29.820
Either is fine.

547
34:30.030 --> 34:31.360
Pick one. Look.

548
34:31.510 --> 34:32.360
Which color?

549
34:32.360 --> 34:33.159
This one then.

550
34:35.920 --> 34:37.550
Since you've seen through it,

551
34:37.550 --> 34:38.840
