583
36:13.710 --> 36:14.510
Mother,

584
36:14.630 --> 36:15.360
Madam Li.

585
36:16.920 --> 36:17.590
Mother,

586
36:18.000 --> 36:19.190
all of Hengtang is talking about

587
36:19.190 --> 36:21.120
Chunzhi and Qingyuan's marriage.

588
36:21.280 --> 36:24.140
